// WHEA-Logger warnings on a node: corrected hardware errors, for example 17 (PCI Express),
// 19 (processor) or 47 (memory). A single one is harmless. A series on the same node can announce
// a failing DIMM, processor or PCIe device before it takes the node down.
Event
| where EventLog == "System" and Source in ("Microsoft-Windows-WHEA-Logger") and EventLevelName == "Warning"
| extend NodeName = tolower(tostring(split(Computer, ".")[0])),
         EventIdText = strcat("WHEA-Logger/", tostring(EventID))
| summarize EventCount = count() by NodeName, EventIdText
